    "title": "[Perf][DeepSeek V4] Default to block FP8 MoE activations on Hopper with EP",
    "user": {
      "login": "mgoin",
      "id": 3195154,
      "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjMxOTUxNTQ=",
      "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3195154?v=4",
